    886 !**** Fluxes   KF is the instantaneous flux in g/m3/s, KFS is the summed flux in g eventually divided by elapsed time betwee
    886 n calls to FLUX output and converted to kg below
    887     
    888     
    889     IF (FLUX(JW)) THEN  
    890       IF (JDAY >= NXTMFL(JW) .OR. JDAY >= FLXD(FLXDP(JW)+1,JW)) THEN  
